; The one variable: a Control scene tile root that its minimum size grows upwards (grow_vertical = 0),
; in a y-sorted TileMapLayer. The root is 2 px tall with a minimum height of 30, so its canvas item
; sits 28 px above its top edge (control.cpp:1773-1797) and sorts before the red child at y 80 that
; its top edge alone would put after it. unit-tile-map-layer-scene-tiles has no y-sorted layer.

